  "title": "1-4 · 可以放下一会儿",
  "background": "bg_env_corridor_battle",
  "music": "unheard_memory",
  "authorship": "Project original dialogue; 2026-10-11 revision, preserves existing chapter events and character unlocks.",
  "completionFlags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0",
      "speaker": "",
      "character": "",
      "text": "书壳从中间松开，散成一地写满排名的便笺。澪把剑尖放低，另一只手仍按着肩上的带子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "1",
      "speaker": "神谷悠真",
      "character": "kamiya_yuma",
      "text": "今天到这里吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "speaker": "雨宫澪",
      "character": "amamiya_mio",
      "text": "还有别的地方可能——",
      "emotion": "serious"
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "speaker": "{player}",
      "character": "",
      "text": "我们可以一起检查。你先坐一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "speaker": "雨宫澪",
      "character": "amamiya_mio",
      "text": "我站在前面，就能少一个人被卷进来。以前一直是这样。",
      "emotion": "serious"
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "speaker": "神谷悠真",
      "character": "kamiya_yuma",
      "text": "今天前面有人，后面也有人。你不用再按以前的办法算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "speaker": "",
      "character": "",
      "text": "她终于把剑袋放到长椅旁，肩膀一点点松下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "speaker": "雨宫澪",
      "character": "amamiya_mio",
      "text": "……那帮我拿一下。就到校门口。",
      "emotion": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "speaker": "{player}",
      "character": "",
      "text": "好。面包也带上，调查还没有包晚饭。"
    }
  ]
}
